{"id":"vod_hh_71390","vodId":"71390","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"兽电战队强龙者","name_cn":"兽电战队强龙者","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第48集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/d4a45417dc63cad037f89d1e3c9fd634.jpg"},"summary":"遥远的恐龙时代，被称为星际病害随着陨石到地球。就连恐龙也被他们消灭。但是有一群幸存下来经由神圣之力而进化的恐龙在历经奋战后，将邪恶首脑冰冻封印拯救地球。之后它们就与贤神托林以及认同的勇者继续守护世界。随着时间的流逝，被封印的宿敌苏醒。面对地球上的生命被消灭的危机，在托林的努力下，五名勇者集结组成队伍，透过寄宿着恐龙灵魂的“兽电池”来驱动的“兽电龙”一同努力对抗邪恶军团！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-10-27 11:18:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":48,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Xe0rWxKb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/rb2lG9Ne/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/PdyWnVga/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/RdGNjAJb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9b6prmQe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aKo68xa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/qaQxXLLe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9b6wpr9d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/penAvYld/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9b6lWVQe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/pen07pRb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/yb8nl5oe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/RdGJqBrb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aMPLP3e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepvZ6pb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/DdwDy9ze/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/RdGONkrd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9aAG4p7d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第19集